Ontology(<http://www.ease-crc.org/ont/SOMA-Allen.owl>
Import(<http://www.ease-crc.org/ont/SOMA.owl>)
Annotation(rdfs:comment "OWL 2 DL compatible entry point for SOMA temporal relations. The inherited temporal hierarchy remains in SOMA.owl. Asymmetry and irreflexivity of the eight Allen relations cannot be expressed as property characteristics here because these properties are non-simple. Validate these conditions separately with the accompanying ValidateAllen tool. The validator checks entailed relations between named individuals; it is not a complete interval-algebra decision procedure.")

Declaration(ObjectProperty(SOMA:after))
Declaration(ObjectProperty(SOMA:before))
Declaration(ObjectProperty(SOMA:contains))
Declaration(ObjectProperty(SOMA:during))
Declaration(ObjectProperty(SOMA:finishedBy))
Declaration(ObjectProperty(SOMA:finishes))
Declaration(ObjectProperty(SOMA:startedBy))
Declaration(ObjectProperty(SOMA:starts))

